ander ahead 56-35, and a Saint Anselm poll in August had her up 15. In-state pollsters have shown her leading throughout 2026, with margins ranging from 12 to 21 points.\n\nGoodlander also holds a commanding financial edge, having raised more than three times Williams' total and holding $2.7 million in the bank. Ratings from ten national analysts cluster at Safe or Solid Democratic, and prediction markets give her roughly a 94 percent chance of winning. The district's modest Democratic lean means a surprise is not impossible, but every measurable signal points to Goodlander winning a second term.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9818, "margin": 13.85}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9772, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.978, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9829, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9791, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9795, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9872, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9799, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9889, "margin": 15.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9903, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9889, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9877, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9731, "margin": 13.0}]}